  "description": "ALL-NEW to the lineup – Aluminum Primer 14”.\n\nThe newest addition to our starter bike lineup is built around a newly-designed lightweight aluminum frame; all while retaining a classic look and durability. The aluminum frame is an added advantage to young riders who are just starting out, and this new 14\" option opens the door for even more riders to enjoy Sunday quality as a potential first bike. Key details include a seat/post combo in a comfortable level riding position along with an adjustable reach brake lever that can be tailored to each rider.\n\nUsing Sunday's proven geometry, the Primer 14” rides like a pro-level bike that has been scaled down to meet the needs of smaller riders. These bikes feature quality parts like Odyssey Springfield Brakes, cables and a fully sealed cassette hub for reliability that you can count on every time.\n\nWe look forward to seeing more kids on a Sunday.",
